(4: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0AIssue%20%233%20asks%20for%20%22full%20support%20for%20%2A%2Atxt%2A%2A%2C%20markdown%20and%20html%20in%20mixed%20mode%2C%22%20but%0A%60MARKUP_LANGUAGE_TARGETS%60%20%28%60src%2Fparity.rs%60%29%20currently%20lists%20only%20Markdown%20and%20HTML.%0APlain%20text%20is%20the%20one%20explicitly-named%20container%20with%20no%20registry%20entry.%20See%0A%5B%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frequirements.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frequirements.md%29%20%E2%86%92%20%2A%2ALANG-TXT%2A%2A.%0A%0APlain%20text%20is%20also%20architecturally%20important%3A%20it%20is%20the%20%2A%2Adegenerate%20container%2A%2A%0A%28the%20whole%20buffer%20is%20a%20single%20prose%2Fregion%20link%29%20and%20the%20%2A%2Afallback%2A%2A%20when%0Acontent-sniffing%20cannot%20identify%20an%20embedded%20region%27s%20language%2C%20which%20makes%20the%0Amixed-mode%20contract%20total%20%E2%80%94%20every%20byte%20belongs%20to%20some%20region.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20Add%20a%20%60Txt%60%20entry%20to%20%60MARKUP_LANGUAGE_TARGETS%60.%0A-%20Add%20a%20%60LANGUAGE_FIXTURES%60%20entry%3A%20a%20multi-line%20UTF-8%20plain-text%20sample%20that%0A%20%20round-trips%20byte-for-byte%20through%20%60reconstruct_text%28%29%60.%0A-%20Make%20the%20region%20detector%20in%20%60src%2Fmixed_regions.rs%60%20fall%20back%20to%20a%20single%20%60txt%60%0A%20%20region%20when%20no%20language%20is%20detected.%0A-%20No%20external%20dependency%20required.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60MARKUP_LANGUAGE_TARGETS%60%20includes%20%60txt%60%3B%20the%20parity%20gate%20in%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%60tests%2Funit%2Flink_network.rs%60%20passes.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20A%20%60txt%60%20%60LANGUAGE_FIXTURES%60%20entry%20parses%20and%20reconstructs%20exactly%20%28including%20a%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20trailing%20newline%20and%20a%20non-ASCII%20line%29.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Content-sniffing%20with%20no%20match%20yields%20one%20%60txt%60%20region%20rather%20than%20an%20error.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Changelog%20fragment%20added%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Requirement%3A%20%5B%60requirements.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frequirements.md%29%20LANG-TXT%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%203%0A-%20Founding%20vision%3A%20%231%20%C2%A73.2%20%28mixed-language%20parsing%29%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F01-plain-text-container-target.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
