(25: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0A%60NATURAL_LANGUAGE_TARGETS%60%20%28%60src%2Fparity.rs%60%29%20and%20%60docs%2Fparity-roadmap.md%60%20pin%20the%0A10%20natural%20languages%20to%20the%20Britannica%2FEthnologue%20total-speaker%20list.%20The%20%2A%2Aset%20of%0A10%20is%20correct%20and%20verified%2A%2A%2C%20but%20the%20%2A%2Aordering%2A%2A%20drifts%20from%20Ethnologue%202025%20in%0Atwo%20places%20%28see%0A%5B%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fonline-research.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fonline-research.md%29%20%C2%A72%29%3A%0A%0A%7C%20Position%20%7C%20Repo%20%7C%20Ethnologue%202025%20%7C%0A%7C---%7C---%7C---%7C%0A%7C%205%20%7C%20French%20%7C%20Modern%20Standard%20Arabic%20%7C%0A%7C%206%20%7C%20Modern%20Standard%20Arabic%20%7C%20French%20%7C%0A%7C%208%20%7C%20Russian%20%7C%20Portuguese%20%7C%0A%7C%209%20%7C%20Portuguese%20%7C%20Russian%20%7C%0A%0ABecause%20fixtures%20are%20keyed%20by%20language%20name%20%28not%20rank%29%2C%20this%20is%20%2A%2Acosmetic%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20no%0Acode%20behavior%20depends%20on%20it%20%E2%80%94%20but%20the%20doc%20comment%20should%20not%20claim%20an%20order%20the%0Acited%20source%20contradicts.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0APick%20one%3A%0A-%20%2A%2A%28a%29%2A%2A%20Reorder%20to%20match%20Ethnologue%202025%20%28Arabic%20%235%2C%20French%20%236%2C%20Bengali%20%237%2C%0A%20%20Portuguese%20%238%2C%20Russian%20%239%29%2C%20or%0A-%20%2A%2A%28b%29%2A%2A%20Add%20a%20note%20that%20ranks%20are%20approximate%20%28sources%2Fyears%20disagree%20on%20the%0A%20%20Arabic%2FFrench%20and%20Portuguese%2FRussian%20pairs%29%20and%20the%20%2Aset%2A%20is%20what%20is%20pinned.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60NATURAL_LANGUAGE_TARGETS%60%20ordering%20and%20%60docs%2Fparity-roadmap.md%60%20agree%20with%20the%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20cited%20source%2C%20or%20carry%20an%20explicit%20%22approximate%20order%22%20note.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Parity%20gate%20still%20passes%20%28all%2010%20present%29.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Changelog%20fragment%20added%20%28%60bump%3A%20patch%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Data%3A%20%5B%60online-research.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fonline-research.md%29%20%C2%A72%0A-%20Source%3A%20%3Chttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.britannica.com%2Ftopic%2Flanguages-by-total-number-of-speakers-2228881%3E%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F02-natural-language-ordering-note.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
