(39: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0AThe%20crate%20currently%20parses%20every%20fixture%20with%20a%20generic%2C%20language-agnostic%0Ascaffold%20parser%20%28%60src%2Flink_network.rs%60%29%3B%20the%20only%20dependency%20is%20%60clap%60.%20To%20deliver%0Areal%20%22in%20and%20out%22%20support%20for%20the%20programming-language%20targets%20%28issue%20%233%29%20we%20need%0Agrammar-aware%20parsing.%20tree-sitter%20is%20the%20highest-leverage%20choice%3A%20one%20adapter%0Ayields%20lossless%20spans%2C%20error%20recovery%2C%20queries%2C%20and%20language%20injection%20across%0A%2A%2Aevery%2A%2A%20grammar%20that%20exists.%20See%0A%5B%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frust-libraries-survey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frust-libraries-survey.md%29%0A%C2%A7A%20and%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%201.%0A%0AThis%20single%20adapter%20covers%20%2A%2A7%20of%2010%2A%2A%20TIOBE%20targets%20immediately%20%28Python%2C%20C%2C%20Java%2C%0AC%2B%2B%2C%20C%23%2C%20JavaScript%2C%20R%20%E2%80%94%20all%20have%20official%20MIT%20grammar%20crates%29%20and%20underpins%0ACORE-1%2F3%2F4%2F5%2F7%20and%20PAR-1.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20Define%20a%20%60LanguageParser%60%20trait%20and%20a%20%60tree-sitter%60%20%E2%86%92%20links%20adapter%20that%2C%20per%0A%20%20node%2C%20emits%20a%20link%20with%20%60LinkType%60%2C%20named%2Fanonymous%20flag%2C%20field%20label%0A%20%20%28tree-sitter%20fields%20%E2%86%92%20%60LinkType%3A%3AField%60%29%2C%20%60ByteRange%60%2C%20and%20row%2Fcol%20%60Point%60s%3B%0A%20%20synthesizes%20%60Trivia%60%2F%60Token%60%20links%20from%20inter-child%20byte%20gaps%3B%20maps%20%60ERROR%60%2F%0A%20%20%60MISSING%60%20nodes%20to%20%60LinkFlags%60.%0A-%20Add%20deps%3A%20%60tree-sitter%60%20%2B%20%60tree-sitter-python%60%2C%20%60-c%60%2C%20%60-java%60%2C%20%60-cpp%60%2C%0A%20%20%60-c-sharp%60%2C%20%60-javascript%60%2C%20%60-r%60.%0A-%20Re-back%20the%207%20corresponding%20%60LANGUAGE_FIXTURES%60%20entries%20with%20real%20parses%2C%20keeping%0A%20%20the%20byte-exact%20round-trip%20assertion.%0A-%20Keep%20the%20generic%20scaffold%20parser%20as%20the%20fallback%20for%20languages%20without%20a%20grammar.%0A-%20Honor%20NFR-1%3A%20translate%20tree-sitter%20%22node%2Ftree%22%20vocabulary%20to%20links%20at%20the%0A%20%20boundary%3B%20never%20expose%20it.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20The%207%20languages%20parse%20with%20their%20real%20grammars%20and%20%60reconstruct_text%28%29%20%3D%3D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20input%60%20byte-for-byte%20for%20each%20fixture.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20An%20error%20fixture%20%28e.g.%20truncated%20%60if%20%28%60%29%20produces%20%60is_error%60%2F%60is_missing%60%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20links%20%2A%2Aand%2A%2A%20still%20round-trips%20the%20original%20bytes.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20tree-sitter%20fields%20appear%20as%20%60LinkType%3A%3AField%60%20labeled%20links.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20passes%3B%20crate-size%2Ffile-size%20gates%20still%20pass.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Changelog%20fragment%20added%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Notes%0A%0A-%20Visual%20Basic%2C%20SQL%2C%20and%20Delphi%20are%20%2A%2Anot%2A%2A%20covered%20here%20%28no%20official%20grammars%29%20%E2%80%94%0A%20%20see%20%5B%2310%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F10%29%2C%0A%20%20%5B%2311%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F11%29%2C%20and%0A%20%20%5B%2312%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F12%29.%0A-%20A%20native-Rust%20JS%20alternative%20%28%60biome_js_parser%60%29%20may%20be%20added%20later%20as%20a%20second%0A%20%20source%20%28NFR-5%20%22try%20both%22%29%3B%20out%20of%20scope%20for%20this%20issue.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Survey%3A%20%5B%60rust-libraries-survey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frust-libraries-survey.md%29%20%C2%A7A%2C%20%C2%A7B%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%201%0A-%20Requirements%3A%20LANG-PL%2C%20CORE-1%2F3%2F4%2F5%2F7%2C%20PAR-1%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F03-tree-sitter-front-end.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
