(53: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0AIssue%20%233%20requires%20txt%2Fmarkdown%2Fhtml%20%22in%20%2A%2Amixed%20mode%2A%2A.%22%20The%20crate%20already%20tracks%0Athe%20four%20%60GRAMMAR_EMBEDDING_TARGETS%60%20%28Markdown%2Bcode%2C%20Markdown%2BHTML%2C%20HTML%2BJS%2C%0AHTML%2BCSS%29%20and%20has%20detection-only%20scaffolding%20in%20%60src%2Fmixed_regions.rs%60.%20The%0Aremaining%20work%20is%20to%20actually%20parse%20each%20embedded%20region%20with%20its%20own%20grammar%20and%0Aattach%20the%20results%20to%20the%20host%20as%20%2A%2Aone%2A%2A%20links%20network%20with%20cross-language%20links%0Aon%20shared%20byte%20ranges%20%E2%80%94%20the%20explicit%20divergence%20from%20tree-sitter%27s%20N-disjoint-trees%0Amodel%20named%20in%20issue%20%231%20%C2%A71.%20See%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%0ASolution%205.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20Use%20tree-sitter%20%2A%2Ainjection%2A%2A%20to%20model%20fenced-code%20%2F%20%60%3Cscript%3E%60%20%2F%20%60%3Cstyle%3E%60%0A%20%20embedding.%0A-%20Detect%20regions%20%2A%2Aboth%2A%2A%20ways%20%28NFR-5%29%3A%20name-driven%20%28fence%20tag%2C%20%60%3Cscript%20type%3E%60%2C%0A%20%20extension%29%20%2A%2Aand%2A%2A%20content-driven%20%28sniff%20the%20body%3B%20%60lingua%60%2F%60whatlang%60%20for%20prose%2C%0A%20%20lightweight%20signatures%20for%20code%29.%20Default%20documented.%0A-%20Parse%20each%20region%20via%20the%20appropriate%20grammar%20adapter%20%28from%0A%20%20%5B%237%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F7%29%29%20and%20link%20it%0A%20%20into%20the%20host%20network%20keyed%20on%20its%20byte%20range.%0A-%20Whole-document%20%60reconstruct_text%28%29%60%20stays%20byte-exact.%0A-%20Fall%20back%20to%20a%20%60txt%60%20region%20%28%5B%235%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F5%29%29%0A%20%20when%20sniffing%20fails.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Each%20of%20the%20four%20embedding%20targets%20produces%20%2A%2Aone%20connected%2A%2A%20network%20%28not%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20separate%20parse%20results%29%2C%20with%20cross-language%20links%20on%20shared%20byte%20ranges.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Whole-document%20reconstruction%20is%20byte-for-byte%20exact%20for%20all%20four%20fixtures.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Both%20name-driven%20and%20content-driven%20detection%20are%20exercised%20by%20fixtures.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20passes.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Changelog%20fragment%20added%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%205%0A-%20Requirements%3A%20LANG-MIX%2C%20CORE-7%0A-%20Blocked%20by%3A%20%5B%237%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F7%29%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F04-mixed-mode-embedding.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
