(67: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0AIssue%20%233%20requires%20%22in%20and%20out%22%20for%20the%2010%20natural%20languages.%20Byte-exact%0Areconstruction%20is%20already%20a%20storage%20property%20%28the%20scaffold%20keeps%20UTF-8%20bytes%20%2B%0Aspans%29%2C%20so%20the%20added%20value%20is%20a%20%2A%2Asegmentation%20%2B%20identification%2A%2A%20link%20layer%20that%0Aannotates%20the%20text%20without%20ever%20mutating%20the%20stored%20bytes.%20See%0A%5B%60rust-libraries-survey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frust-libraries-survey.md%29%20%C2%A7D%20and%0A%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%204.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20%2A%2ASegmentation%3A%2A%2A%20%60unicode-segmentation%60%20%28UAX%2329%29%20for%20the%209%20space%2Fdelimiter%0A%20%20scripts%3B%20%60lindera%60%20%28CJK%20dictionary%29%20for%20%2A%2AMandarin%2A%2A%2C%20which%20UAX%2329%20cannot%0A%20%20word-segment.%0A-%20%2A%2AIdentification%3A%2A%2A%20%60lingua%60%20%28default%3B%2075%20languages%20incl.%20all%2010%29%20with%20%60whatlang%60%0A%20%20as%20a%20configurable%20alternative%20%28NFR-5%29.%0A-%20%2A%2ANormalization%2Fbidi%3A%2A%2A%20%60unicode-normalization%60%20%28NFC%2FNFD%29%20and%20%60unicode-bidi%60%0A%20%20%28Arabic%2FUrdu%20RTL%29%20as%20annotation%20only.%0A-%20Emit%20%60Token%60%2F%60Semantic%60%2F%60Language%60%20links%20over%20the%20existing%20lossless%20text%20via%20a%0A%20%20script-aware%20dispatch%20%28CJK%20%E2%86%92%20lindera%2C%20else%20%E2%86%92%20unicode-segmentation%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20All%2010%20natural-language%20fixtures%20still%20reconstruct%20byte-for-byte%20%28stored%20bytes%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20untouched%29.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Mandarin%20%28%60%E4%BD%A0%E5%A5%BD%E3%80%82%60%29%20is%20word-segmented%20via%20%60lindera%60%3B%20a%20Latin%20sample%20via%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%60unicode-segmentation%60%3B%20an%20Arabic%2FUrdu%20sample%20carries%20bidi%2Fnormalization%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20annotation.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Language%20identification%20populates%20a%20%60Language%60%20link%20per%20region%3B%20detector%20is%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20switchable%20%28%60lingua%60%2F%60whatlang%60%29.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20passes.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Changelog%20fragment%20added%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Survey%3A%20%5B%60rust-libraries-survey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frust-libraries-survey.md%29%20%C2%A7D%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%204%0A-%20Requirements%3A%20LANG-NL%2C%20CORE-5%2F6%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F05-natural-language-segmentation.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
