(137: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0A%60src%2Fsnapshots.rs%60%20provides%20%60NetworkSnapshot%60%20%2B%20%60MutableNetworkSnapshot%60%20with%0Aprovenance%20and%20forward%20version%20commits%2C%20but%20without%20persistent%20structural%20sharing.%0AIssue%20%231%20%C2%A73.5%20requires%20immutable%20snapshots%20that%20are%20%22persistent%2C%20structurally%0Ashared.%22%20The%20rowan%2Fcstree%20green%2Fred%20model%20is%20the%20reference.%20See%0A%5B%60rust-libraries-survey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frust-libraries-survey.md%29%20%C2%A7B%20and%0A%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%206.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20Implement%20structural%20sharing%20for%20%60NetworkSnapshot%60%20along%20the%20green%2Fred%20model%0A%20%20%28deduplicated%2C%20position-independent%20green%20links%3B%20lazily-resolved%20absolute%0A%20%20offsets%29.%0A-%20Evaluate%20%2A%2Astring%20interning%2A%2A%20%28cstree-style%29%20so%20identical%20terms%20share%20storage%20%E2%80%94%0A%20%20consistent%20with%20%22identical%20terms%20are%20the%20same%20link.%22%0A-%20Optionally%20evaluate%20the%20ecosystem-native%20%2A%2A%60doublets%60%2A%2A%20crate%20%28Unlicense%29%20as%20a%0A%20%20file-backed%20substrate%20for%20large%20networks%20%28%60Doublets%60%20trait%29.%0A-%20Keep%20both%20trivia%20attachment%20policies%20working%20across%20snapshots%20%28NFR-5%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Forking%20a%20%60MutableNetworkSnapshot%60%2C%20editing%20one%20link%2C%20and%20committing%20leaves%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20the%20original%20snapshot%20reconstructing%20the%20%2A%2Aold%2A%2A%20bytes%20while%20the%20fork%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20reconstructs%20the%20%2A%2Anew%2A%2A%20bytes.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Unchanged%20subtrees%20are%20structurally%20shared%20%28no%20full%20deep%20copy%29%20%E2%80%94%20demonstrated%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20by%20a%20test%2Fbenchmark.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20passes%3B%20changelog%20fragment%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Survey%3A%20%5B%60rust-libraries-survey.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Frust-libraries-survey.md%29%20%C2%A7B%2C%20%C2%A7E%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%206%0A-%20Requirements%3A%20CORE-11%2F12%2C%20PAR-5%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F10-persistent-snapshots.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
