(151: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0AOnce%20the%20tree-sitter%20adapter%0A%28%5B%237%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F7%29%29%20and%20the%20enriched%0Amatcher%20%28%5B%2313%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F13%29%29%20exist%2C%20the%0Acodemod%20story%20%28jscodeshift%2FRecast%20parity%2C%20PAR-3%2FPAR-4%29%20needs%20a%20single%20ergonomic%0Asurface%3A%20select%20links%20with%20a%20query%2C%20transform%20with%20a%20substitution%20rule%2C%20and%0Are-serialize%20preserving%20every%20unchanged%20byte.%20See%0A%5B%60competitor-test-suites.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fcompetitor-test-suites.md%29%20%28Recast%2Fjscodeshift%29%20and%0A%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solutions%201%20%26%207.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20A%20%60find%28query%29%20-%3E%20captures%60%20%2B%20%60replace%28rule%29%60%20API%20over%20the%20network%2C%20delegating%0A%20%20matching%20to%20%5B%2313%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F13%29%27s%0A%20%20S-expression%20matcher%20and%20rewriting%20via%20%60apply_substitution%60.%0A-%20Guarantee%20that%20a%20transform%20touching%20one%20target%20leaves%20all%20other%20bytes%20identical%0A%20%20%28the%20Recast%20%60strictEqual%28source%2C%20code%29%60%20%2F%20jscodeshift%20%60__testfixtures__%60%0A%20%20guarantee%29.%0A-%20Port%20one%20jscodeshift-style%20input%2Foutput%20fixture%20pair%20%28e.g.%20identifier%20rename%29%20and%0A%20%20one%20Recast-style%20%22change%20only%20the%20literal%22%20fixture.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20A%20query%20selects%20exactly%20the%20intended%20links%3B%20a%20transform%20rewrites%20only%20those.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%2