(232: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0ACross-language%20transformation%20is%20only%20meaningful%20if%20two%20languages%20sharing%20a%20concept%0Areference%20the%20%2A%2Asame%2A%2A%20concept%20link%20%28issue%20%231%20%C2%A73.4%2C%20CORE-10%29.%20%60LinkType%3A%3AConcept%60%0Aand%20the%20%60Semantic%60%20projection%20exist%2C%20but%20no%20concept%20ontology%20is%20populated.%0Ameta-expression%20already%20ships%20%60semantic-lexicon.json%60%20%28%2A%2A351%20concepts%2A%2A%2C%20en%2Fhi%2Fru%2Fzh%0A%E2%80%94%20verified%2C%20correcting%20issue%20%231%27s%20%22328%22%29.%20See%0A%5B%60ecosystem-foundations.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fecosystem-foundations.md%29%20%28meta-expression%29%20and%0A%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%208.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20Import%20meta-expression%27s%20%60semantic-lexicon.json%60%20as%20concept%20links%20%28anchored%20to%0A%20%20Wikidata%20QIDs%20where%20present%2C%20e.g.%20Hawaii%20Q782%2C%20U.S.%20state%20Q35657%29.%0A-%20Seed%20a%20shared%20set%20of%20structural%20concepts%20for%20functional%2Fprocedural%20languages%0A%20%20%28function%2C%20binding%2C%20application%2C%20sequence%2C%20branch%2C%20loop%2C%20%E2%80%A6%29.%0A-%20Map%20each%20concept%20to%20per-language%20concrete%20syntax%20for%20the%20initial%20language%20set%3B%0A%20%20enforce%20dedup%20%28one%20concept%20link%20shared%20across%20languages%2C%20not%20duplicated%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20The%20lexicon%20imports%20as%20concept%20links%3B%20the%20count%20matches%20the%20source%20file.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Two%20languages%20expressing%20the%20same%20concept%20reference%20the%20%2A%2Asame%2A%2A%20concept%20link%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%28asserted%20by%20a%20test%29.%0A-%20%