(265: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0AThe%20crate%27s%20deepest%20novelty%20%28issue%20%231%20%C2%A73.7%2C%20CORE-16%2F17%29%3A%20reconstruct%20a%20network%20into%0Aa%20%2A%2Adifferent%2A%2A%20target%20language%20via%20the%20common%20concept%20layer%2C%20and%20make%20text%E2%86%92network%0Aand%20network%E2%86%92text%20%2A%2Aconfigurable%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20the%20exact%20knob%20formal-ai%20and%20meta-expression%0Aneed%20%28formalization%20levels%201%E2%80%934%2C%20naturalization%29.%20%60reconstruct_text%28%29%60%20is%0Asame-language%20only%20today.%20See%0A%5B%60ecosystem-foundations.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fecosystem-foundations.md%29%20%28meta-expression%29%20and%0A%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%208.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20Implement%20cross-language%20reconstruction%3A%20walk%20concept%20links%0A%20%20%28%5B%2317%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F17%29%29%20%E2%86%92%0A%20%20target-language%20concrete%20syntax.%0A-%20Validate%20with%20meta-expression%27s%20worked%20example%3A%20%22Hawaii%20is%20a%20state.%22%20%28Q782%20%2F%0A%20%20Q35657%29%20%E2%86%92%20%22%D0%93%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B8%20%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE%20%D1%88%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82.%22%20%28en%20%E2%86%92%20ru%29.%0A-%20Add%20configurable%20%28de%29formalization%20to%20%60ParseConfiguration%60%3A%20formalization%20levels%0A%20%201%E2%80%934%2C%20naturalization%20direction%3B%20expose%20without%20leaking%20consumer%20internals.%0A-%20Keep%20%60TruthValue%60%20%28many-valued%2Fparadox%29%20available%20for%20the%20semantic-match%20path%0A%20%20%28relative-meta-logic%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20A%20network%20parsed%20from%20English%20reconstructs%20into%20Russian%20for%20the%20Hawaii%20fixture%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%28and%20the%20reverse%29.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Same-language%20reconstruction%20stays%20byte-exact%20for%20unchanged%20regions.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Formalization%20level%20is%20configurable%20and%20changes%20output%20as%20documented.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20passes%3B%20changelog%20fragment%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Ecosystem%3A%20%5B%60ecosystem-foundations.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fecosystem-foundations.md%29%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%208%0A-%20Requirements%3A%20CORE-16%2F17%2C%20PAR-12%0A-%20Blocked%20by%3A%20%5B%2317%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F17%29%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F14-cross-language-reconstruction.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
