%20MIT%2FPSF%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Each%20of%20the%20six%20upstreams%20contributes%20multiple%20ported%20fixtures%20%28not%20just%20one%29%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20each%20with%20a%20provenance%20comment.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20All%20four%20pillars%20are%20represented%20for%20at%20least%20tree-sitter%2C%20LibCST%2C%20Recast%2F%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20jscodeshift%2C%20and%20Roslyn.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20passes%3B%20changelog%20fragment%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Suites%3A%20%5B%60competitor-test-suites.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fcompetitor-test-suites.md%29%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%209%0A-%20Requirements%3A%20I3-2%2C%20PAR-1%E2%80%A66%0A-%20Blocked%20by%3A%20%5B%237%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fissues%2F7%29%0A%20%20%28real%20grammars%20make%20many%20fixtures%20meaningful%29%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F15-adopt-external-competitor-corpora.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
