(331: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %0A%23%23%20Context%0A%0AThe%20link-foundation%20%2F%20linksplatform%20projects%20are%20%22internal%20competitors%22%20whose%0Acorpora%20this%20crate%20must%20subsume%20%28issue%20%231%20%C2%A76%2C%20I3-2%29.%20APIs%2C%20test%20shapes%2C%20and%20verified%0Acorrections%20are%20documented%20in%0A%5B%60ecosystem-foundations.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fecosystem-foundations.md%29.%20All%20are%0AUnlicense%2Fpermissive.%0A%0A%23%23%20Scope%0A%0A-%20%2A%2Alinks-notation%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20port%20the%20doublet%2Ftriplet%2FN-tuple%2Findented%2Fself-reference%0A%20%20parsing%20tests%20%28cross-language%20identity%3B%20%7E138%20tests%2Flanguage%20binding%29.%0A-%20%2A%2Alink-cli%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20create%20%60%28%29%20%28%281%201%29%29%60%2C%20update%20%60%28%281%3A%201%201%29%29%20%28%281%3A%201%202%29%29%60%2C%20delete%0A%20%20%60%28%281%201%29%29%20%28%29%60%2C%20swap%20%60%28%28%28%24index%3A%20%24source%20%24target%29%29%20%28%28%24index%3A%20%24target%20%24source%29%29%29%60.%0A-%20%2A%2Alino-objects-codec%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20%60decode%28encode%28x%29%29%20%3D%3D%20x%60%2C%20shared%20%2B%20circular%20references.%0A-%20%2A%2Arelative-meta-logic%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20dependent%20types%2C%20many-valued%2C%20liar-paradox%20cases%20%E2%86%92%0A%20%20%60TruthValue%60.%0A-%20%2A%2Aformal-ai%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20replay%20%60data%2Fseed%2F%2A.lino%60%20%2B%20%60data%2Fbenchmarks%2F%2A.lino%60%20as%20a%0A%20%20no-regression%20gate%20%28cite%20the%20actual%20files%2C%20%2A%2Anot%2A%2A%20issue%20%231%27s%20unverified%20%22706%22%29.%0A-%20%2A%2Ameta-expression%2A%2A%20%E2%80%94%20formalize%E2%86%92naturalize%20round-trip%20%28%22Hawaii%20is%20a%20state.%22%20%E2%86%92%0A%20%20%22%D0%93%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%B8%20%D1%8D%D1%82%D0%BE%20%D1%88%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82.%22%29%2C%20%221%20%2B%201%20%3D%202%22%2C%20%22this%20statement%20is%20false%22%3B%20cite%20the%20verified%0A%20%20%2A%2A351%2A%2A-concept%20lexicon%20%28not%20%22328%22%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Acceptance%20criteria%0A%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Each%20ecosystem%20project%20contributes%20ported%20fixtures%20with%20provenance%20comments.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20The%20formal-ai%20corpus%20runs%20as%20a%20regression%20gate%20against%20the%20actual%20%60.lino%60%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20files.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Verified%20figures%20%28351%20concepts%2C%20%7E138%20tests%2Flang%2C%20doublets%20crate%20name%29%20are%20used%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20in%20comments%20%E2%80%94%20not%20the%20founding-issue%20estimates.%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20%60cargo%20test%20--all-features%60%20passes%3B%20changelog%20fragment%20%28%60bump%3A%20minor%60%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20References%0A%0A-%20Ecosystem%3A%20%5B%60ecosystem-foundations.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fecosystem-foundations.md%29%0A-%20Solution%3A%20%5B%60solution-plans.md%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flink-foundation%2Fmeta-language%2Fblob%2Fmain%2Fdocs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fsolution-plans.md%29%20Solution%209%0A-%20Requirements%3A%20I3-2%2C%20PAR-7%E2%80%A612%0A%0A---%0A_Filed%20from%20%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-3%2Fproposed-issues%2F16-adopt-ecosystem-corpora.md%60.%20Part%20of%20the%20implementation%20plan%20for%20%233._%0A) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
